DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261015T160000
UID:9fb4c52b91a5c9baf29fa417@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Led by a team of Order Members and Mitra Convenors\, join this
  long weekend to take your understanding and practice of Buddhism deeper i
 n a strongly communal context. On this retreat we'll be emphasising Buddhi
 st ideas through talks and discussion\, following the unique life and teac
 hings of the Tibetan teacher Milarepa.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/womens-intensive-long-we
 ekend-oct-2026
