BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Life Inside with Maitreyabandhu and Andy West
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261017T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261017T213000
UID:4fb58edb1178644ea9fde6a6@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Special Event with Andy West As Seen on the BBC: What can men 
 in prison teach us about being free? Andy West grew up in a family marked 
 by prison. Years later he went inside himself\, as a teacher\, leading phi
 losophy conversations with men behind bars. He’ll share stories from tho
 se places and what they taught him about anger\, shame\, courage and conne
 ction. Interviewed by Maitreyabandhu\, he’ll explore his story and persp
 ective. Andy's book has been made into a successful BBC TV drama "Waiting 
 for the Out". The evening promises to give us a chance to hear a unique pe
 rspective on the way things are and what it means for us.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/the-life-inside-with-mai
 treyabandhu-and-andy-west
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
